---@field renewalMethod? gcp.domains_v1.ManagementSettingsRenewalMethodEnum|string Output only. The actual renewal method for this `Registration`. When `preferred_renewal_method` is set to `AUTOMATIC_RENEWAL`, the actual `renewal_method` can be equal to `RENEWAL_DISABLED`—for example, when there are problems with the billing account or reported domain abuse. In such cases, check the `issues` field on the `Registration`. After the problem is resolved, the `renewal_method` is automatically updated to `preferred_renewal_method` in a few hours.
